<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts BA estimates.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts BA estimates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts at NatWest Securities on Tuesday cut earnings forecasts for British Airways, market sources said.</p>
<p>Annual pre-tax profit estimates were revised to 505 million stg from 653 million stg previously and to 674 million from 783 million for 1999, the sources said.</p>
<p>The analysts at NatWest were unavailable for immediate comment.</p>
<p>British Airways reported first-quarter profits of 220 million stg on Monday but the underlying profit growth fell short of analysts expectations.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
